  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.77 “Unit” means, for the purposes of this chapter, a fossil fuel-fired stationary boiler, combustion turbine, or combined cycle system.\n\nSource. #10468, eff 1-1-14 (from Env-A 4602.73); ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.78)",
